{TEXT 274 5 "rkf45" }{TEXT -1 94 " refers to a Runge-Kutta numerical p
rocedure. If we wish to obtain the numerical estimate for " }{TEXT 
272 6 "y(0.5)" }{TEXT -1 38 ", say, then all we need to do is type\n" 
